-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are rounded to the nearest cent:
+- monthly plans cost their price per month
+- yearly plans cost their price divided by 12 per month
+- weekly plans cost their price × 52 ÷ 12 per month (€12 a week is €52 a month)
 
